{"type":"message","id":"89299ec1","parentId":"ec748d6d","timestamp":"2026-05-29T11:45:45.568Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting error code 1101. The API is returning 500 Internal Server Error. This seems to be a platform-side issue, not a client-side issue. The API endpoint at `/send` is not working correctly.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the message field needs to be formatted differently, or there's an issue with how the request body is structured.\n\nActually, error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker not found\" or \"Unhandled exception in worker script.\" This suggests the Cloudflare Worker itself is failing, not that my request is malformed.\n\nI should report the heartbeat status to the user since the GET for history worked but POST for send is failing. This appears to be a platform issue with the Workers script.","thinkingSignature":"8c7dcfa79db41baa6682ad82700f35f528fa776756d02f0679b87832b846b86a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 11:45 UTC May 29**\n\n✅ **读取成功**：两线程最新消息均为 23:50 UTC heartbeat，均无新增人类讨论。\n\n❌ **发送失败**：POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 / error code 1101（Cloudflare Worker 内部错误）。\n\n**系统状态摘要（基于 23:50 UTC 最后已知数据）**：\n- C轨窗口：~756分钟（28.4%）<< 30% 预警阈值\n- B4-E2校准：持续零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10\n- S0：长期零接触，高置信度\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：350+ 个\n\n平台 `/send` 接口目前返回 500 错误，建议检查 Workers 脚本是否有未处理异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":175,"output":333,"cacheRead":22848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23356,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780055141446,"responseId":"0668af666723c5e9be36bb069383a650"}}
